{"reviewId": "394312996_895yGZvHC", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 12, "content": "库兹涅茨周期遵循典型的四阶段演进规律：上升期 → 见顶 → 回落期 → 筑底盘整。每一轮完整周期约18-20年，上升期通常占约16年，下行期约4年。根据库兹涅茨周期的四阶段框架，当前中国房地产市场正处于“回落向筑底过渡”的关键阶段，但筑底可能是一个相对温和但持续数年的过程，而不是短期内V型反转。 筑底后的政策引导发展方向：从增量到存量，从规模到质量", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "如库兹涅茨周期（也被称为建筑业周期或房地产周期）等。", "range": "7545-7571", "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterIdx": 12, "reviewId": "394312996_895yGZvHC", "userVid": 394312996, "topics": [], "createTime": 1778731161, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 394312996, "name": "我是Zn", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/AHEla05LlXJL9uaqf2B4mehOyYRykNMXNich68mFGzHsfh283yqOn6EmfmwtnHIz4hLgicF3V62vibFmuJtpJRoasBw9dEic0ibpnfb1gBUicxuDg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 214936062, "name": "JOJO", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0014-u0XHnjeMbaLcTEAqEG9_V10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "JOJO", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "库兹涅茨周期比较适用于美国这种市场化经济", "reviewId": "394312996_895yGZvHC", "commentId": "3